sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as API caller
    participant D as Django
    participant CH as ClickHouse
    participant S as Transactional sends
    participant J as Manager, codec
    C->>D: GET emails/?status=scheduled
    Note right of D: flag gates, read throttles
    D->>S: list route, JWT team only
    S->>J: listUnclaimed(team, cursor, limit)
    Note right of J: index (team_id, scheduled, id) where<br/>email, available, transition_count 0.<br/>Filter: scheduled > now()
    J-->>S: id, scheduled, created, state
    S->>J: decodeJobState(state)
    S-->>C: id, to, scheduled_at, created_at, cursor
    C->>D: GET emails/{id}
    Note right of D: id-age gate 60 days
    D->>CH: argMax(status) for message_id
    alt no row yet
        D-->>C: 404
    else a row
        D-->>C: 200 status, no send time
    end
